 I want to make sure that I have the right details in mind for whatever comes next. Dates and times can sometimes get a bit tricky when you’re navigating through different time zones. Okay, I'm all set for November 10 now!\"}]},{\"id\":\"fc_081dc096dd114a34016af117ea245087d084cd39ce97c31d4b\",\"type\":\"function_call\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"tools call calendar.list --json - <<'JSON'\\\\n{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-11-10T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\"}\\\\nJSON\\\\ntools call mail.draft --json - <<'JSON'\\\\n{\\\\\\\"reply_to\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"msg_e4ec40d0d5944320\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"dana@example.test\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\"subject\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Hi Dana,\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nI'll bring the latest Q3 Budget spreadsheet to the planning review, including the Q3 travel line for Finance. Here's the sheet: [Q3 Budget](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget).\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThanks,\\\\\\\\nSam\\\\\\\"}\\\\nJSON\\\",\\\"timeout\\\":null}\",\"call_id\":\"call_qkOiZDkdSHSifGBTD2e0oWDI\",\"name\":\"bash\"}],\"parallel_tool_calls\":true,\"presence_penalty\":0.0,\"previous_response_id\":null,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1bdc5-33dd-7250-8242-77e8f86d8aa2\",\"prompt_cache_retention\":\"24h\",\"reasoning\":{\"context\":\"all_turns\",\"effort\":\"medium\",\"mode\":\"standard\",\"summary\":\"detailed\"},\"safety_identifier\":null,\"service_tier\":\"default\",\"store\":false,\"temperature\":1.0,\"text\":{\"format\":{\"type\":\"text\"},\"verbosity\":\"medium\"},\"tool_choice\":\"auto\",\"tool_usage\":{\"image_gen\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"input_tokens_details\":{\"image_tokens\":0,\"text_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"image_tokens\":0,\"text_tokens\":0},\"total_tokens\":0},\"web_search\":{\"num_requests\":0}},\"tools\":[{\"type\":\"function\",\"description\":\"Execute a bash command in the current